Version 1.1.2 (2026/09/30)
* Undaunted Crests will now be auto-looted

Version 1.1.1 (2026/09/02)
* Minor code cleanup

Version 1.1.0 (2026/03/03)
* Added support for Update 49
* Added support for consoles

Version 1.0.16 (2024/10/29)
* Imperial Fragments will now be auto-looted

Version 1.0.15 (2024/04/20)
* Players are now exempted from stealth checks for the looting of stolen
  items from inventory containers if they are in a safe area (e.g., outlaws
  refuges, houses, etc.)

Version 1.0.14 (2024/04/05)
* API version bump for Update 41 (Scions of Ithelia)

Version 1.0.13 (2023/10/31)
* Archival Fortunes will now be auto-looted

Version 1.0.12 (2021/06/01)
* API version bump for Update 30 (Blackwood)

Version 1.0.11 (2021/03/08)
* API version bump for Update 29 (Flames of Ambition)

Version 1.0.10 (2020/11/23)
* Smart Looter will now use LootAll if the number of different slots to be
  looted in a single action exceeds 20, to avoid the issue of triggering an
  excessive-message server kick; in practice, this issue really only affects
  the looting of containers for PTS template characters

Version 1.0.9 (2020/11/07)
* With the greatly increased transmute crystal cap and the ability to "store"
  excess transmutes by reconstructing a 25-crystal item, Smart Looter will now
  auto-loot transmute geodes that contain 20 or fewer crystals, if doing so
  will not overflow the transmute crystal cap

